                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Mehmaan Sakina</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Mayda baba(a.s)</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>Hayo baba(a.s) </p>
<p>mayda baba(a.s) </p>
<ol><li>(Hik waar to awin haan) x2</li><p>Hay mar bachri wanjheena</p><p>Kuch din de hai mehmaan sakina(s.a)</p><li>Inj baad teday baba hai umat nay sataya</li><p>Rat abiday(a.s) bemaar di ankhya kon ruvaya</p><p>Zindagi day har ek pal k thiya moot da saya</p><p>(Hay moot day darya vech) x2</p><p>Ay saahwan da safeena</p><p>(Kuch din di hai mehmaan sakina(s.a)) x2</p><li>Ek lamha masaeb di jhari nay ruki baba(a.s)</li><p>Aa dekh medi ankhya haan da dhi runi baba(a.s)</p><p>Dhaavi tu ajaantay may koi nay suti baba(a.s)</p><p>(Kuch dair may samjhi haan) x2</p><p>Milay teda jay seena</p><p>(Kuch din di hai mehmaan sakina(s.a)) x2</p><li>Zindan day vich rokay hai faryaad karaindi</li><p>May naal jo sanri day rahi qaid nebhaindi</p><p>Hum rondi ta har sainr may koi hosala dandi</p><p>(Tanha may thai qaid haan) x2</p><p>Honrh koi koi na</p><p>(Kuch din di hai mehmaan sakina(s.a)) x2</p><li>Day jhorhka teday laash ton kaatil nay uthaya</li><p>Kan maiday thai zakhmi sitam aisa kamaya</p><p>Hay naal makon ghoray day zaalim nay bhajaya</p><p>(Ay baad teday milya) x2</p><p>Hai dardaanda khazeena</p><p>(Kuch din di hai mehmaan sakina(s.a)) x2</p><li>Kan dukh day sada sainr day hin khoon rawa hai</li></ol>

<p>Masroof rasan sainr da gal paak raja hai</p>
<p>Quaim ko sada dayndi karaindi yeh fughan hai</p>
<p>(Bahlool aja sainr hai) x2</p>
<p>""Farhan"" thai na</p>
<p>(Kuch din di hai mehmaan sakina(s.a)) x4</p></font></p>
